{%- else -%}
Adversary check ({{ adversary }}):
- When the other agents have finished, call {{ adversary }} last, right before your final report.
  Give it the task, the changed files and the other agents' claims, quoted.
{% if implementer_isolated -%}
- {{ implementer }} works in its own git worktree: merge its branch into the working branch before
